{"id": "EUVD-2026-97884", "enisaUuid": "e45d4e97-8ed2-3c6e-894e-414f7897bf11", "description": "goose from 1.28.0 before 1.44.0 contains an authorization bypass vulnerability that allows tools to run without user approval in Manual Approval mode because persisted read-only annotations are never cleared by update_goose_mode. After a session uses Smart Approval mode, prompt-injected calls to tools annotated readOnlyHint: true execute without prompting, bypassing the user's selected approval mode in PermissionInspector::inspect.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T20:55:15", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-12T20:55:15", "baseScore": 2.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:P/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/pull/10528", "https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/commit/b0f4e2a0f1a5507aa0a0fbe73d0b5c77a3e86845", "https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/blob/v1.43.0/crates/goose/src/permission/permission_inspector.rs#L159", "https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/releases/tag/v1.44.0", "https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/goose-from-1.28.0-before-1.44.0-manual-approval-bypass-via-read-only-tool-annotations"], "aliases": ["GHSA-8h69-7j5q-pwfc", "CVE-2026-109561"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "6db64260-6e41-32a9-88d4-84210dd1f173", "product": {"name": "goose", "vendor": {"name": "aaif-goose"}}, "product_version": "1.28.0 <1.44.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "9b4c4da4-d5ef-3d19-98e6-a43c98d59fad", "vendor": {"name": "aaif-goose"}}], "isExploited": false}